{"id":530,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"講座制と探究で進路を広げる筑陽学園","feature_description":"筑陽学園は、校訓『人を愛し ひとに愛される人間』のもと、自発心と自立心を育てる学校です。講座制や探究活動、学科ごとの学びを通じて、自分の目標に合わせて学習を組み立てられるのが特徴です。部活動見学や学園紹介も充実しており、進路に応じて学びを選びやすい環境があります。講座選択を通じて将来像を具体化しやすい点も特徴で、高校生活で自ら動ける設計です。","clubs":[{"id":10447,"name":"男子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10448,"name":"女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10449,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10450,"name":"女子ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10451,"name":"男子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10452,"name":"女子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10453,"name":"女子バレー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10454,"name":"男子バレー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10455,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10456,"name":"男子水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10457,"name":"女子水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10458,"name":"男子陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10459,"name":"女子剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"http://www.chikuyogakuen.ed.jp/bukatsu/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10460,"n